\* All TLC check configs for AntflyRepairArtifactRecovery.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySkipArtifactRecovery = FALSE
    BuggyLeaveRecoveryUndrained = FALSE
    BuggyReuseFailedCandidate = FALSE
    BuggyPlannerUsesNameCounter = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteCandidateNeverActivates
    ReadyGenerationHasNoStartupDebt

PROPERTIES
    AutomaticRepairEventuallyStabilizes

==== BadSkipArtifactRecovery
\* Rebuilding cannot manufacture a corrupt/missing managed source artifact.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySkipArtifactRecovery = TRUE
    BuggyLeaveRecoveryUndrained = FALSE
    BuggyReuseFailedCandidate = FALSE
    BuggyPlannerUsesNameCounter = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteCandidateNeverActivates
    ReadyGenerationHasNoStartupDebt

PROPERTIES
    AutomaticRepairEventuallyStabilizes

==== BadLeaveRecoveryUndrained
\* Queuing durable recovery without a foreground drain leaves repair waiting.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySkipArtifactRecovery = FALSE
    BuggyLeaveRecoveryUndrained = TRUE
    BuggyReuseFailedCandidate = FALSE
    BuggyPlannerUsesNameCounter = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteCandidateNeverActivates
    ReadyGenerationHasNoStartupDebt

PROPERTIES
    AutomaticRepairEventuallyStabilizes

==== BadReuseFailedCandidate
\* Replaying the same snapshot candidate cannot fill a deficit below its floor.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySkipArtifactRecovery = FALSE
    BuggyLeaveRecoveryUndrained = FALSE
    BuggyReuseFailedCandidate = TRUE
    BuggyPlannerUsesNameCounter = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteCandidateNeverActivates
    ReadyGenerationHasNoStartupDebt

PROPERTIES
    AutomaticRepairEventuallyStabilizes

==== BadPlannerUsesNameCounter
\* A stale cross-generation counter makes the repaired index look surplus.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySkipArtifactRecovery = FALSE
    BuggyLeaveRecoveryUndrained = FALSE
    BuggyReuseFailedCandidate = FALSE
    BuggyPlannerUsesNameCounter = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    IncompleteCandidateNeverActivates
    ReadyGenerationHasNoStartupDebt

PROPERTIES
    AutomaticRepairEventuallyStabilizes
